# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SHARED NAVIGATION MENU  (www/menu.jemdoc)
#
# This ONE file controls the menu on EVERY page of the main site.
#   * The FIRST line is the site name, and it is the link to the home page.
#   * A line WITHOUT brackets is a coloured section heading (e.g. "Research").
#   * A line with brackets is a link:   Visible text [target-file.html]
#   * Put the text of a long label inside {{double braces}} if you do not want
#     it to be forced onto one line, e.g.   {{PhD / Master students}} [x.html]
#   * Menu order = order in this file. Keep it in sync with the pages.
#
# The Edge AI Lab has a sidebar of its own: www/menu-lab.jemdoc.
# The course pages use THIS menu, like every other page of the main site.
#
# Careful: jemdoc marks the current entry with a SUFFIX test, so one page name
# must never be the tail of another. See guide.md §6.4.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
